ff review:**\n\n1. **`sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt`** ✅\n   - Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE` to ErrorCode enum\n   - This file had to change because there's no existing error code for shipment state conflicts\n   - Consistent with existing error code pattern\n\n2. **`sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt`** ✅\n   - Added new `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` endpoint\n   - Implements all required logic:\n     - Returns 404 for non-existent shipments\n     - Returns 200 OK for CREATED → CONFIRMED transition\n     - Returns 200 OK (idempotent) for already CONFIRMED\n     - Returns 409 for CANCELLED shipments\n   - Persists changes via repository.save()\n   - This file had to change as it's the natural place for the endpoint\n\n3. **`sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt`** ✅\n   - Added 4 comprehensive tests covering all scenarios:\n     - Confirm CREATED → CONFIRMED transition\n     - Confirm already CONFIRMED (idempotent)\n     - Reject CANCELLED shipment\n     - Reject non-existent shipment\n   - Tests verify status codes and error codes\n   - This file had to change to add tests as required\n\n**Unresolved findings:**\n\nNone. All requirements have been implemented and tested.\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement: Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint to move shipments from CREATED to CONFIRMED status, with idempotent behavior for already-confirmed shipments, rejecting cancelled or non-existent shipments.\n\nChanged:\n- `sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt` — Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE error code for shipment state conflicts\n- `sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt` — Added POST /{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint implementing state transitions and error handling\n- `sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Added 4 tests covering confirm behavior: CREATED→CONFIRMED, idempotent CONFIRMED, CANCELLED rejection, and 404 for missing shipments\n\nTests:\n- \"confirms a CREATED shipment and transitions to CONFIRMED\" — Verifies 200 OK and status change from CREATED to CONFIRMED\n- \"confirms an already CONFIRMED shipment is idempotent\" — Verifies 200 OK and no state change when confirming twice\n- \"rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with conflict error\" — Verifies 409 Conflict with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE error code\n- \"rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with not found error\" — Verifies 404 Not Found with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND error code\n\nVerification: Ran `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/` — BUILD SUCCESS, 17 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors\n\nNot done: Nothing. All acceptance criteria met, all tests pass, no unrelated files modified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3353,"cache_read_input_tokens":25225,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3353},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"af92d7b2-e06c-40f7-92d2-42130c3ab8e8","uuid":"8619abb3-3e1c-4402-87d2-4eabaff4aea9","timestamp":"2026-09-10T18:42:05.745Z","request_id":"req_011CevFSbAFTYmJtCvUUxzko"}
